.TH EUCLID-CLI-EAP-GET-PLATFORM 1 "October 2026" "euclid-cli 1.0.53" "Euclid CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
euclid-cli-eap-get-platform \- show a platform declaration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B euclid-cli eap get-platform
.RB [ \-\-name | \-n
.IR NAME ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows a platform declaration of the current namespace: the objects it owns,
and the declaration last applied with
.BR "eap apply \-\-platform" .
The name defaults to
.IR platform .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR euclid-cli-eap-apply (1),
.BR euclid-cli-eap-list-platforms (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Jens Vogt <jensvogt47@gmail.com>
